# Admin console: never framed, never indexed, never sniffed.
# No CSP here on purpose — the panel uses inline onclick handlers throughout,
# so a script-src without 'unsafe-inline' would disable every control.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
